# --- secrets -------------------------------------------------------------
.env
.env.*
!env.example
*.pem
id_rsa*
*.key
credentials.json
token.json

# --- Claude Code local state --------------------------------------------
.claude/settings.local.json

# --- tool debris (appears unasked, carries LIVE credentials) -------------
# See bootstrap P3a: .playwright-mcp/ has shipped Gmail session URLs with tokens.
.playwright-mcp/
.crawl4ai/
.firecrawl/
*.log

# --- PRIVATE WORKSPACE: never published ----------------------------------
# This repo is public-by-destination. Case material (I-485 / EB-1 / EB-2 NIW),
# applicant facts, business-specific research and raw batch payloads live here
# and are never committed. See CLAUDE.md "Publication boundary".
private/
runs/
out/
# reviews/ added 2026-08-18: `git status` showed it untracked but NOT ignored
# while it held 320 KB of external-panel output quoting the applicant's filing
# posture. One `git add -A` would have published it.
# Under-publish rather than over-publish — a push is irreversible. Opt a
# specific methodology review back in with `git add -f` if one is ever meant to ship.
reviews/

# .claude/state/ added 2026-08-19, and the reason is structural rather than
# incidental. NOW.md and history/ exist to record what a round FOUND, and what a
# round finds is by construction material about a live case: names of people who
# never consented to appear here, filing dates, adverse-notice history. A literal
# audit on 2026-08-19 caught third-party surnames written into a TRACKED NOW.md
# during the very session that wrote the rule forbidding it.
# Sanitising this family every session is discipline; ignoring it is structure, and
# structure is what survives a bad day. Methodology genuinely meant to ship belongs
# in docs/ as a written-for-publication document, not as leaked session state.
.claude/state/
*.jsonl
!schemas/*.jsonl
!tests/fixtures/*.jsonl

# --- python --------------------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/
venv/
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
*.egg-info/
dist/
build/

